Make in India had three stated objectives:
to increase the manufacturing sector&#039;s growth rate to 12-14% per annum;
to create 100 million additional manufacturing jobs in the economy by 2022;
to ensure that the manufacturing sector&#039;s contribution to GDP is increased to 25% by 2022 (later revised to 2025).

